Subject: [PATCH 1/6] Build against uniffi 0.32.2

The engine pins uniffi =0.32.2. The pull request builds against 0.32.0, which reads the
same metadata (0.32.1 and 0.32.2 changed only Kotlin), but the generator and the scaffolding
come from one release here, as with the Swift and Kotlin generators.
